# Rebuild after changes

After finishing UI, JS, asset, or Capacitor config changes, always ship a fresh native build before stopping. Do not leave the user on a stale APK.

1. `npm run cap:sync` (Vite production build + `npx cap sync`)
2. Assemble debug APK with Homebrew JDK 21:

```bash
export JAVA_HOME="/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home"
export PATH="$JAVA_HOME/bin:$PATH"
cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
```

3. Report the APK path: `android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`

Skip only if the user explicitly says not to rebuild.
